      "line": 5,
      "zh": "每天可赠送一次仓库中价值最低的作物。达到 3/6/9 心会解锁农场增益。",
      "en": "Once a day you can give the lowest-value crop in storage. Reaching 3/6/9 hearts unlocks farm perks."
